### ====================================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### ====================================================================

# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json


### ====================================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION — REGISTER
### ====================================================================

### 2.1 Register User Baru (Sukses)
### Response akan mengembalikan api_token dan data user
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "username": "budi123",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 2.2 Register — Validasi Error (Password kurang dari 6 karakter) [Expect: 400 Bad Request]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Bu",
  "username": "b",
  "password": "123"
}

### 2.3 Register — Conflict Error (Username sudah terdaftar) [Expect: 409 Conflict]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "username": "budi123",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}


### ====================================================================
### 3. AUTHENTICATION — LOGIN
### ====================================================================

### 3.1 Login (Sukses)
### Response akan mengembalikan jwt_token & api_token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi123",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 3.2 Login — Kredensial Salah [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi123",
  "password": "password_salah"
}


### ====================================================================
### 4. USER PROFILE (PROTECTED BY JWT)
### ====================================================================

### 4.1 Get Profile — Mengambil token otomatis dari response login
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.2 Get Profile — Menggunakan variable manual @authToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.3 Get Profile — Tanpa Token / Token Kosong [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Accept: application/json


### ====================================================================
### 4B. API TOKEN MANAGEMENT (PROTECTED BY JWT) — [UPGRADE 1]
### ====================================================================
### Semua endpoint di bawah ini hanya bisa mengelola token MILIK USER YANG LOGIN.
### Menggunakan jwt_token user biasa (bukan admin).

### 4B.1 List Token — GET /api/tokens
### Menampilkan semua token milik user yang login
# @name listTokens
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4B.2 Create Token — POST /api/tokens (Sukses) [Expect: 201 Created]
# @name createToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Token Laptop Kerja"
}

### 4B.3 Create Token — Dengan ExpiresAt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Token Sementara",
  "expires_at": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 4B.4 Create Token — Validasi Gagal (name kosong) [Expect: 400 Bad Request]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### 4B.5 Detail Token — GET /api/tokens/{{tokenId}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens/{{tokenId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4B.6 Detail Token — Token Milik User Lain / Tidak Ada [Expect: 404 Not Found]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4B.7 Update Status Token — PUT /api/tokens/{{tokenId}}/status (Nonaktifkan)
### Setelah dinonaktifkan, token ini akan ditolak oleh APIKeyAuth (401)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens/{{tokenId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 4B.8 Update Status Token — Aktifkan Kembali
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens/{{tokenId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": true
}

### 4B.9 Delete Token — DELETE /api/tokens/{{tokenId}} (Hard Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens/{{tokenId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4B.10 List Token — Tanpa JWT [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens
Accept: application/json


### ====================================================================
### 5. OPENAI-COMPATIBLE MODELS (UNTUK 9ROUTER / ONE-API / NEXTCHAT)
### ====================================================================

### 5.1 Get Models List — GET /v1/models (Dibutuhkan saat 9router klik "Fetch Models")
# @name getModelsV1
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/models
Accept: application/json

### 5.2 Get Models List — GET /models (Untuk router yang baseURL-nya tanpa /v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/models
Accept: application/json

### 5.3 Get Model Detail — GET /v1/models/zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/models/zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita
Accept: application/json


### ====================================================================
### 6. OPENAI-COMPATIBLE CHAT COMPLETIONS (UNTUK 9ROUTER / OPENAI SDK)
### ====================================================================

### 6.1 Chat Completions — POST /v1/chat/completions (Standar 9router)
# @name chatCompletions
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userApiKey}}

{
  "model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "Kamu adalah asisten pintar."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Halo! Siapa kamu dan apa kemampuanmu?"
    }
  ]
}

### 6.3 Chat Completions — POST /v1/chat/completions dengan STREAMING (stream: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userApiKey}}

{
  "model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hitung 1 sampai 5."
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}

### 6.4 Anthropic Messages — POST /v1/messages dengan STREAMING (stream: true) [Format Trae / 9router]
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{userApiKey}}

{
  "model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Halo, tes streaming dari 9router."
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}



### ====================================================================
### 7. AI GENERATE (CUSTOM SINGLE PROMPT /v1/messages)
### ====================================================================

### 7.1 AI Generate — Menggunakan model default dari .env
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{userApiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "Jelaskan keunggulan bahasa Go (Golang) dalam 2 kalimat singkat."
}

### 7.2 AI Generate — Custom Model & Prompt
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{userApiKey}}

{
  "model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "prompt": "Halo, Apa itu AI?"
}

### 7.3 AI Generate — Menggunakan Header Authorization: Bearer <api_token>
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userApiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "Sebutkan 3 tips produktivitas programming."
}


### ====================================================================
### 8. NEGATIVE TESTING / ERROR CASES UNTUK AI ENDPOINT
### ====================================================================

### 8.1 AI Generate — Tanpa API Key [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Tes tanpa API key"
}

### 8.2 AI Generate — API Key Salah / Palsu [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: hf_invalid_token_1234567890

{
  "prompt": "Tes dengan token palsu"
}

### 8.3 AI Generate — Prompt Kosong / Validasi Gagal [Expect: 400 Bad Request]
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{userApiKey}}

{
  "prompt": ""
}

### 8.4 AI Generate — Model Tidak Ada / Nonaktif di DB [Expect: 400 Bad Request]
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{userApiKey}}

{
  "model": "model/tidak-ada-di-db",
  "prompt": "Tes model yang tidak terdaftar"
}


### ====================================================================
### 9. ADMIN — AI MODELS CRUD (PROTECTED BY JWT + ADMIN ONLY) — [UPGRADE 2]
### ====================================================================
### Semua endpoint membutuhkan JWT dengan role "admin".
### Login dulu sebagai admin (ADMIN_USERNAME / ADMIN_PASSWORD dari .env), lalu
### JWT-nya otomatis dipakai via {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}.

### 9.0 Login Admin — ambil JWT admin untuk dipakai section berikutnya
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 9.1 List Models — GET /api/admin/models (Semua model, aktif & nonaktif)
# @name adminListModels
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9.2 Create Model — POST /api/admin/models (Sukses) [Expect: 201 Created]
# @name adminCreateModel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mistral 7B Instruct",
  "slug": "mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2",
  "description": "Model Mistral 7B Instruct",
  "is_active": true
}

### 9.3 Create Model — Tanpa is_active (default aktif = true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Qwen 2.5 72B Instruct",
  "slug": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct",
  "description": "Model Qwen 72B"
}

### 9.4 Create Model — Validasi Gagal (name & slug kosong) [Expect: 400 Bad Request]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "slug": ""
}

### 9.5 Create Model — Slug Duplikat [Expect: 409 Conflict]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mistral Duplikat",
  "slug": "mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2",
  "description": "Slug sama dengan model yang sudah ada"
}

### 9.6 Detail Model — GET /api/admin/models/{{modelId}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models/{{modelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9.7 Detail Model — Tidak Ditemukan [Expect: 404 Not Found]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9.8 Update Model — PUT /api/admin/models/{{modelId}} (Partial update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models/{{modelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mistral 7B Instruct (Updated)",
  "description": "Deskripsi baru hasil update",
  "is_active": true
}

### 9.9 Update Model — Nonaktifkan Model (is_active: false)
### Setelah nonaktif, model ini akan ditolak saat dipakai di /v1/messages (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models/{{modelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 9.10 Delete Model — DELETE /api/admin/models/{{modelId}}
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models/{{modelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9.11 Akses Admin — Pakai JWT User Biasa [Expect: 403 Forbidden]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9.12 Akses Admin — Tanpa JWT [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/models
Accept: application/json


### ====================================================================
### 10. ADMIN — CONFIGS CRUD (PROTECTED BY JWT + ADMIN ONLY) — [UPGRADE 3]
### ====================================================================
### Konfigurasi HuggingFace (HF_API_KEY, HF_MODEL, HF_BASE_URL) bisa diubah dari DB
### tanpa restart server. Nilai dibaca dari DB, fallback ke ENV bila belum ada.

### 10.1 List Configs — GET /api/admin/configs
# @name adminListConfigs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.2 Create Config — POST /api/admin/configs (Sukses) [Expect: 201 Created]
# @name adminCreateConfig
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "HF_MODEL",
  "value": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "description": "Model HuggingFace default"
}

### 10.3 Create Config — Validasi Gagal (key kosong) [Expect: 400 Bad Request]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "",
  "value": "nilai_baru"
}

### 10.4 Create Config — Key Duplikat [Expect: 409 Conflict]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "HF_MODEL",
  "value": "model/lain",
  "description": "Key sudah ada"
}

### 10.5 Detail Config — GET /api/admin/configs/{{configId}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs/{{configId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.6 Detail Config — Tidak Ditemukan [Expect: 404 Not Found]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.7 Update Config — PUT /api/admin/configs/{{configId}}
### Update value HF_API_KEY / HF_MODEL / HF_BASE_URL akan langsung dipakai request AI berikutnya
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs/{{configId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "zai-org/GLM-5.3:novita",
  "description": "Model HuggingFace default (diubah via admin)"
}

### 10.8 Delete Config — DELETE /api/admin/configs/{{configId}}
### Setelah dihapus, nilai akan fallback ke ENV
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs/{{configId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.9 Akses Config — Pakai JWT User Biasa [Expect: 403 Forbidden]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.10 Akses Config — Tanpa JWT [Expect: 401 Unauthorized]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/configs
Accept: application/json
